# LIMPET: the demo player plays the whole game from the title with button
# presses: through the hub's maze and its gates (with their scenes), every
# deck, the Turncoat (Beacon) and the Dreadnought (Saucer), to the ending and
# back to the station. At the original's scale this takes it nearly twenty
# minutes of play, and its best times add up to over twenty minutes.
game limpet
wait 5
botuntil state == 2 600
expect level == 29
botuntil cleared >= 4 30000
botuntil cleared >= 9 30000
botuntil turncoat == 1 40000
expect goals == 1
botuntil cleared >= 22 60000
botuntil dread == 1 60000
expect goals == 3
expect cleared == 26
expect frame > 60000
expect total_best > 40000
botuntil state == 6 4000
botuntil state == 2 4000
expect level == 29
expect save_wins == 1
